0余种。","sourceName","赛柏蓝","sourceUrl","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTA4Mzc2Mg==&mid=2653668987&idx=2&sn=e01ed76db2a0fb0f22169dcfb5b44a82&chksm=bc0ab55523d461340521489e1246638de8da1bd861234f43aa74335da841167861b2167d83a1&scene=126&sessionid=1793627968#rd","publishedAt","2026-11-01T11:46:16.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F6BqBCkCD1bg8EOJKO4icJ1QlstDibu4HuDRmxsxweYJquTYc9twadYxCOlcxueicaj2sBmqmGpoOKudB5ll2pP5Wg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=167030ae1e219003","sourceIconSrcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F6BqBCkCD1bg8EOJKO4icJ1QlstDibu4HuDRmxsxweYJquTYc9twadYxCOlcxueicaj2sBmqmGpoOKudB5ll2pP5Wg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar-48&exp=1795651200&sig=b828ff70e947816f 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F6BqBCkCD1bg8EOJKO4icJ1QlstDibu4HuDRmxsxweYJquTYc9twadYxCOlcxueicaj2sBmqmGpoOKudB5ll2pP5Wg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=167030ae1e219003 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"swyk9tsr6zj9ijrlr8nkydhns","流感样病例暴发疫情升至145起，百亿流感药市场竞争升温","中国疾控中心2026年第43周流感监测周报显示，全国报告145起流感样病例暴发疫情，较前一周的28起明显增加，阳性样本中甲型占67.6%、乙型占32.4%。2025年中国流感抗病毒药物市场规模约137亿元，奥司他韦三大终端六大市场销售额超83亿元，PA抑制剂市场由2024年的9亿元增至33亿元。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTA4Mzc2Mg==&mid=2653668987&idx=3&sn=55466c980eb55b56c64a9a8e5c6233a7&chksm=bc2eeeb4be37c6b414e7fe4ea768310f9b6d029103a01b77c590f998dc114489b3fc7fa68c0d&scene=126&sessionid=1793627968#rd","j4zrr31ulofr0ili2zybn9ysp","礼来、阿斯利康等五家MNC公布2026年三季报，中国区表现分化","礼来、阿斯利康、默沙东、BMS、吉利德五家MNC公布2026年三季报，礼来Q3营收243.97亿美元、同比增长39%，市值首破1.3万亿美元。替尔泊肽降糖版与减重版前三季度合计437.68亿美元、占总营收65%，中国区Q3收入9.47亿美元、同比增69%，穆峰达2型糖尿病适应症2026年1月纳入国家医保后最低规格月治疗费降至324.1元。","医药云端工作室","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDEwMDQ2Mg==&mid=2658699442&idx=1&sn=5e7f9d783f3193569a335a7c08b485d1&chksm=bc64fe86fad8057f3a9a51546e6fb212350dcf5c65f74d34e1cfda5f8a9a1eee1c0ad741b05d&scene=126&sessionid=1793627945#rd","2026-11-02T01:42:02.000Z","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=920757ef74ebe49f","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar-48&exp=1795651200&sig=9cb8174b387e7452 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=920757ef74ebe49f 96w",{"_125":144,"_95":-5,"_127":145},{"_125":126,"_95":-5,"_127":128},"label","政策与监管","items",[129,130,131],{"_92":70,"_39":43,"_95":142,"_97":98,"_99":143,"_101":102,"_103":104,"_105":106,"_107":108,"_109":110},{"_92":137,"_39":138,"_95":139,"_97":118,"_99":140,"_101":141,"_103":121,"_105":122,"_107":108,"_109":110},{"_92":132,"_39":133,"_95":134,"_97":118,"_99":135,"_101":136,"_103":121,"_105":122,"_107":108,"_109":110},"wdk21hh936uoy0a7hf88kg2zt","第12批国采江苏11月30日执行，16省已发文","江苏省医保局通知第12批国采将于11月30日24:00起全省统一执行，采购周期至2029年12月31日，11月8日前完成中选规格申报、11月20-24日网签合同、11月26日切换中选价格。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDEwMDQ2Mg==&mid=2658699446&idx=1&sn=e13e688f928045bf4d8d8168d8dca936&chksm=bc49fce15fcc5d20c9d5b99a73f6347085532de390ba5387d1fd8a0397832e1073b9f64a5052&scene=126&sessionid=1793627945#rd","2026-11-02T07:52:39.000Z","dzqr8y6fdp4mzdssmzmlowxwe","福建医保药品单列门诊统筹支付管理办法施行，明确目录准入与调出规则","福建省医保局10月30日印发《福建省医保药品单列门诊统筹支付管理办法》（闽医保规〔2026〕3号），自2026年11月1日施行、有效期五年，替代原试行版本。药品纳入单列支付目录需同时满足四项条件：属于协议期内或已转常规目录的国谈药品、竞价药品；适合门诊治疗；适应症未被现有门诊特殊病种政策完全覆盖；疗程达12周及以上或年度治疗费用偏高。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDEwMDQ2Mg==&mid=2658699453&idx=1&sn=ab85bb7b69202a9b54f9b9bf5e7bd7e8&chksm=bcb1245cbe1b264572e30044905e868a585eb826c0b37f0f4c09a9b8666bb3fceb7939ae7f22&scene=126&sessionid=1793627945#rd","2026-11-02T09:40:38.000Z","截至11月1日，第12批国家集采已有江西、青海、辽宁、海南、河南5省明确执行时间，最早为江西11月16日零时起执行，另有湖南、浙江、四川、广东等11省公布落地安排。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTA4Mzc2Mg==&mid=2653668987&idx=1&sn=81d142da0b370d206a86015ea9aa8cbc&chksm=bc27536f47753d34d04fa37e844bbcf49ec5afe609f1bcfda9ef25015abe78f4b9afc3b13027&scene=126&sessionid=1793627968#rd","行业动态",[146,147],{"_92":154,"_39":155,"_95":156,"_97":98,"_99":157,"_101":158,"_103":104,"_105":106,"_107":108,"_109":110},{"_92":148,"_39":149,"_95":150,"_97":151,"_99":152,"_101":153,"_103":-5,"_107":108,"_109":110},"pnjlx18ya54hc0k99vie6h8b7","哈药集团2026年三季报营收123.52亿元、净利润6亿元同比增82.66%","哈药集团2026年三季报显示，报告期内实现营收123.52亿元（+2.75%）、归母净利润约6亿元（+82.66%），业绩双增。保健品业务延续高增长，钙铁锌口服液、消食化积口服液、朴雪、盖中盖等经典品种叠加GNC品牌产品矩阵，成为线上渠道增长主力；商业板块批发与零售两端同步调整品种结构。","米内网·企业","https://www.menet.com.cn/info/202611/202611020925152515_151369.shtml","2026-11-02T00:00:00.000Z","k1eif37jd2voi25bib80hh174","2026H1公立医疗机构终端83个国谈药销售额超3亿元，合计近640亿元","2026H1中国公立医疗机构终端有83个国谈药销售额突破3亿元，合计接近640亿元，独家品种占比接近90%。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTA4Mzc2Mg==&mid=2653669124&idx=3&sn=a787f98e2cd825710248302fbdcb5f42&chksm=bcc2bd461e0de1a881fb6d13a220f28b3aa7808eb03b38b39e102ebded428aecb339bafbe0e1&scene=126&sessionid=1793624689#rd","2026-11-02T11:51:44.000Z",{"_92":137,"_39":138,"_95":139,"_97":118,"_99":140,"_101":141,"_103":121,"_105":122,"_107":108,"_109":110},{"_92":132,"_39":133,"_95":134,"_97":118,"_99":135,"_101":136,"_103":121,"_105":122,"_107":108,"_109":110},{"_92":154,"_39":155,"_95":156,"_97":98,"_99":157,"_101":158,"_103":104,"_105":106,"_107":108,"_109":110},"leadParagraph",{"_164":165,"_166":-5,"_167":110},"changelogVersion","2026-10-08T08:00","release","staticSite"]
